{"id":"t07-3f2898","status":"read","groups":[{"levels":[[{"surface":"قتيبة بن سعيد","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"محمد بن رمح","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"الليث بن سعد","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"أبو بكر بن أبي شيبة","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"علي بن مسهر","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"ابن نمير","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"أبي","kind":"relation"}],[{"surface":"عبيد الله","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"أبو الربيع","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"أبو كامل","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"حماد","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"زهير بن حرب","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"إسماعيل","kind":"narrator","occurrence":1}],[{"surface":"أيوب","kind":"narrator","occurrence":1}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"ابن أبي عمر","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"سفيان","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"إسماعيل بن أمية","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"محمد بن رافع","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"عبد الرزاق","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"معمر","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"أيوب","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"محمد بن رافع","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"عبد الرزاق","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"ابن، جريج","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"موسى","kind":"narrator"}]]}],"shared_tail":[[{"surface":"نافع","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"ابن عمر","kind":"narrator"}]],"needs_ruling":false,"notes":["Taḥwīl «ح» splits the isnad into branches; the text writes «كل هؤلاء عن نافع، عن ابن عمر» once after the last branch, so that tail belongs to every group.","The last branch (محمد بن رافع) splits in the text itself: معمر→أيوب and ابن، جريج→موسى, both from عبد الرزاق; written as two groups.","«نحو حديث مالك» and «إلا الليث بن سعد» are wording remarks with no transmitter of their own: left out."],"fixes":[]}
